    "detailed_description": "ORTHOISO is a platformer puzzle game about optical illusion. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur game uses orthoganol projection that makes distant objects in 3D look close on 2D screen. This allows the player to achieve impossible things in real world. There are 3 different views in the game. Player needs to switch between these views to solve the puzzle. There are many different mechanics based on optical illusions. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story is a about a little frog named Iso, whose father is a famous adventurer. In one recent adventure, Iso's dad went missing. Iso decided to start his own adventure to find his dad.",
